EphemeralIntentExecutor_Route
├── when triggers are unmet
│   └── it should revert with Underfunded
├── when executed before start
│   └── it should revert with TooEarly
├── when the payload runs
│   ├── it should call the router with the committed payload
│   ├── it should approve trigger tokens to the router for the call
│   ├── it should revoke approvals after the call
│   ├── it should pay the keeper fee
│   └── it should sweep remaining native to the refund recipient
├── when a native trigger exists
│   └── it should forward the native balance as call value
├── when the fee is native
│   └── it should pay the keeper in native
├── when the router call reverts
│   └── it should bubble the revert reason
└── when the fee cannot be paid
    └── it should revert with SendFailed

EphemeralIntentExecutor_Constrained
├── when the delta clears the minimum
│   ├── it should call the router with the keeper route
│   └── it should measure the delta at the recipient
├── when tokenOut is native
│   └── it should measure the native delta at the recipient
├── when the delta is below the minimum
│   └── it should revert with Insufficient
├── when any tokenOut misses its minimum
│   └── it should revert with Insufficient
├── when the route delivers to the executor instead
│   └── it should revert with Insufficient
├── when the exclusivity window is open
│   ├── it should revert with Exclusive for other keepers
│   └── it should execute for the exclusive keeper
└── when the exclusivity window has passed
    └── it should execute for any keeper

EphemeralIntentExecutor_Refund
├── when the deadline has passed
│   ├── it should sweep trigger tokens to the refund recipient
│   ├── it should sweep keeper-listed tokens to the refund recipient
│   ├── it should pay the keeper fee best-effort
│   └── it should not revert on a reverting token
├── when NFTs are keeper-listed
│   └── it should sweep them to the refund recipient
└── when executed on the wrong chain
    ├── it should sweep immediately without waiting for the gates
    └── it should sweep native via selfdestruct
